<title>MALAYSIA: Palmco, Mega First suspended.</title>
<headline>Palmco, Mega First suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Palmco Holdings Bhd and Mega First Corp Bhd were suspended on Thursday pending announcement, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Stock of plantation firm Palmco closed at 3.92 ringgit on Wednesday. Shares of Mega First, which is involved in the mining and production of copper concentrate and other activities, were last traded at 2.19 ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
